# flash of the arduino-uno-r3 fixture board whose second page reads back with ff at 0x85:
# connect-uno, then write-uno up to that page, changed there; the third page is not read, and
# the board is still reset (51 20)
# Arduino Uno R3 (ATmega16U2, Optiboot at 115200): DTR pulse, sync, signature
! identity 2341:0043
! baud 115200
! signals dtr=0 rts=0
! sleep 250
! signals dtr=1 rts=1
! sleep 50
